#   incoming-1: 'scada' holds members only its platform knows
#   incoming-5.maintenance-1: not converted: rule set maintenance is switched on and off (cmd1); its rules apply only while it is active
#   incoming-7: an ICMP type, or a protocol other than TCP, UDP, ICMP and ICMPv6: the MX has no field for it
#   incoming-9: not converted: FROM_IP 'plant_b' is not an IPv4 address, a network or an IP group
